# Design reference recordings are kept out of the repo, but deliberately NOT
# by a blanket `*.mp4` rule. An extension-wide ignore with an allowlist has to
# be updated for every new video the app imports, and when someone forgets,
# the asset is missing from the build with nothing in `git status` to show it
# — the same silent-omission failure that nearly shipped a broken tablet
# image. Unknown files default to tracked, so a stray recording turns up as
# untracked noise instead: loud, and fixed in one line.
